  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "智代子、お疲れ様",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001090010,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あ！　プロデューサーさん！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000109/6010001090010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、嬉しそうだな",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001090020,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "もちろん、すっごく嬉しいです！\r\nだって私たち、優勝したんですよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000109/6010001090020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだな。俺も本当に嬉しいよ\r\n改めて、優勝おめでとう！",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001090030,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はい！\r\nありがとうございます",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000109/6010001090030"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001090040,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……なんだか、ここまで来るのが\r\nあっという間だったような気がします",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000109/6010001090040"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001090050,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ちょっと前まで\r\n本当にチョコアイドルでいいのか悩んでたのに……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000109/6010001090050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなこともあったか……\r\nチョコアイドル、続けてきてよかったな",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001090060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はい！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000109/6010001090060"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001090070,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……でも、少し不思議な気分です",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000109/6010001090070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　どうした？",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001090080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "もしプロデューサーさんに会えてなかったり、\r\nプロデューサーさんが違う子をプロデュースしてたら……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000109/6010001090080"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001090090,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "私、どうなってたのかなって……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000109/6010001090090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "突然だな",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001090100,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "だって、ひとりでチョコアイドルやってたら、\r\n途中で諦めちゃってたかもしれないですもん！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000109/6010001090100"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001090110,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……ちょっと悩んだりもしましたけど",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000109/6010001090110"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001090120,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "今はたくさんの人に知ってもらえて、\r\n『W.I.N.G.』でも優勝できました",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000109/6010001090120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは智代子が頑張ったから……",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001090130,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "いえ！　それだけじゃありません！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000109/6010001090130"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001090140,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ここまで来れたのは、チョコアイドルの私を認めてくれた\r\nプロデューサーさんの力があってこそですっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000109/6010001090140"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001090150,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんがいなかったら、私……\r\nこんなに頑張れてなかったと思います",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000109/6010001090150"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001090160,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……だから、プロデューサーさん\r\n改めて、ありがとうございます！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000109/6010001090160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……智代子はきっと、ひとりでもチョコアイドルを\r\n諦めたりなんかしなかっただろうし",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺がいなくても輝けるアイドルだ",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001090170,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そんなことっ……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000109/6010001090170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、だからこそ言わせてくれ\r\n……ここまで一緒に頑張ってくれてありがとう",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001090180,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "！　……プロデューサーさん……！\r\nえへへ……なんだか照れちゃいますね……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000109/6010001090180"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001090190,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "こんなにたくさん支えてもらったんだから\r\n私も、プロデュースして良かったって思ってもらわなきゃ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000109/6010001090190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もう思ってるよ\r\n智代子をプロデュースできて、本当に良かった",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001090200,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "じゃあ、もっともっと思ってもらえるようにします！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000109/6010001090200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なら、俺も負けないように頑張らないとな！",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001090210,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "えへへ……そうですね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000109/6010001090210"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010001090220,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "これからも、ずーっとよろしくお願いしますね\r\nプロデューサーさん！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000109/6010001090220"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]